hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"391","Yunus bin Abdul-Ala told us, Ibn Wahb told us that Malik told him. H Yahya bin Hakim told us, Bishr bin Omar told us, Malik told us, on the authority of Sumayy, the client of Abu Bakr, on the authority of Abu Salih al-Samman, on the authority of Abu Hurairah The Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, said: “If only people knew what is in the call to prayer and the first row, and then had no choice but to draw arrows on it, \They would have made arrows on him.\"" This is the wording of the hadith of Yahya bin Hakim. Utba bin Abdullah Al-Yahmadi told us: I read this hadith to Malik"," on the authority of Sumayy."""
